WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.825
Energy is never made or destroyed. The total always stays the same.

2
00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:09.951
Turn friction on and run the coaster. Watch the bars and the total.

3
00:00:15.995 --> 00:00:20.445
Potential becomes kinetic, and friction turns some into heat and sound.

4
00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:25.169
The bars change, but they always add up to the same total.
